; Built-in boat dashboard of Rigs of Rods, drawn with DearIMGUI by AngelScript (imgui_boat.as).
; It has no layout file on purpose: the script draws everything (see DashBoardManager::loadDashBoard()).
; Speed, throttle levers with engine switches, heading and rudder, echo sounder, heel/trim, light switches.
; Boats with their own dashboard keep it.

dashboard_name "ImGui - Boat"
dashboard_description "Built-in boat dashboard: speed, throttle levers with engine switches, heading and rudder, echo sounder, heel and trim"
dashboard_category   202
